# Level 1 (planet 1): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots (or not) and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. Magnets 1F (pull) and 20 (push), pillars 15 and 16 with their heads,
# the turrets 01, 03, 04, 07, 09, 0A, 0D and 10, and the hoppers that the generators 4D and 4E make.
level 1
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
